      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "P005 explicitly supplies the feasibility assumption and its verification requirement."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C006_signal_basis",
    "value": "Trials report export counts, the fraction exceeding one hour and uncertainty, with workload and load recorded. Testing is restricted to isolated, resource-capped tests or approved overnight trials and stops when scheduled exports, resource limits or the agreed budget are threatened.",
    "scope": "Performance observations under operational safeguards; these observations do not independently establish safe testing feasibility.",
